<p>The first time you take damage each turn, you regenerate <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">7%, 9%, 11%, 13%, 14%</acronym> of the damage dealt as mana (up to a maximum of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6.00, 7.34, 8.37, 9.24, 10</acronym>) and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6%, 10%, 13%, 15%, 17%</acronym> as equilibrium (up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5.00, 6.72, 7.73, 8.45, 9.00</acronym>).</p><p>Increases Physical Power by 30, increases damage done with shields by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">29%, 42%, 51%, 59%, 66%,</acronym> and allows you to dual-wield shields.</p><p>Also, all of your melee attacks will perform a shield bash in addition to their normal effects.</p>